_:n2d4cf3bfe11241c894a0dbe75d4fd53cb27 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#description> "\n        property onFields specifies the fields in LogicalView that are involved by the structural annotation. The semantics of this involvement depends on the specific annotation.\n        " .
