<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLDatatypeMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n    Represents a Datatype Map.\n    " .
_:n35a43d8e3f4e4494b764f8cc822e7a71b9 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLTermMapShape> .
